  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Poverty Through Community Based Action on Water and Sanitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. GCI will develop civil society capacity to hold government and other agencies accountable for laws and policies affecting poverty.
2. Support actions at community level to develop methods of self-recovery, in particular, technical/community partnerships to address water and sanitation.
3.Strengthen community awareness of the environment by effective popular education programmes and Campaigns.</narrative>
  </description>
